  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tanzania - Wild and Exotic Mushrooms</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Limax BV (LBV) is a Dutch producer and trader of mushrooms, soft fruits like strawberries and compost for mushroom production. LBV has production facilities in The Netherlands and Poland. One of the products LBV trades in is wild mushrooms. These mushrooms are not always available on the European market. Since the demand for this product is increasing, LBV has been looking for alternative sources. Although Tanzania has no experience in exporting mushrooms, there is extensive collection of wild mushrooms for domestic consumption.In this project, LBV wishes to perform a feasibility study to examine the organizational, financial, legal and technical issues involved with the sourcing, packaging and international transport of wild mushrooms whilst loss of quality is kept at a minimum. The outcome of this project will provide LBV with valuable insight into the opportunities and challenges associated with investments in Tanzania. As LBV sets for high standards for good governance and acting morally responsible, LBV will collaborate with FairWild to develop a wild mushroom certification standard. With the aid of RVO, LBV was able to perform the feasibility study throughout the spring of 2020.</narrative>
  </description>
